{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"shaodi-e-p057a","title":"王祥拒拜司马昭荀顗入拜","accounts":[{"id":"shaodi-e-p057a-account","label":"《汉晋春秋》","text":"王祥拒拜司马昭荀顗入拜","evidence":["shaodi-e-p057a-q"]},{"id":"lizang-a-9b4fc7a581eb0a1d9272","label":"裴注·注家按语","text":"裴注：司马文王初为晋王，司空荀顗要祥尽敬，祥不从","evidence":["lizang-q-4b7a0ca51616ea711dea"]}],"participants":[{"person":"shaodi-p0123","role":"长揖","evidence":["shaodi-e-p057a-q"]},{"person":"shaodi-p0090","role":"拜谒","evidence":["shaodi-e-p057a-q"]},{"person":"mingdi-p0097","role":"同诣","evidence":["shaodi-e-p057a-q"]},{"person":"shaodi-p0045","role":"受谒","evidence":["shaodi-e-p057a-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":264,"label":"晋公进王时","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"shaodi-y264","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"shaodi-q-o171","basis":"晋公进王时"},"evidence":["shaodi-e-p057a-q","shaodi-q-o171","shaodi-q-o165","shaodi-q-b-ded6d700dc6f860d1670"]},"ordering_evidence":"shaodi-e-p057a-q","source_order":[4,839,"P057a"],"order":1292}],"persons":[{"id":"mingdi-p0097","name":"何曾","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"shaodi-p0045","name":"司马昭","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"shaodi-p0090","name":"荀顗","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"shaodi-p0123","name":"王祥","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"lizang-q-4b7a0ca51616ea711dea","section":"chapter-018","block":"b-f3c9370bada62331f7ff","layer":"pei","quote":"司马文王初为晋王，司空荀顗要祥尽敬，祥不从","attribution":"裴注·注家按语","section_title":"二李臧文吕许典二庞阎传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0041.xhtml","index":128,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-bac345b63c40d7fb8707","start":49,"end":70,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-e-p057a-q","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-a9aba59d5fa2ff03e048","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝一﹞《汉晋春秋》曰：“晋公既进爵为王，太尉王祥、司从何曾、司空荀顗并诣王。顗曰：‘相王尊重，何侯与一朝之臣皆已尽敬。今日便当相率而拜，无所疑也。’祥曰：‘相国位势，诚为尊贵，然要是魏之宰相；吾等，魏之三公。公、王相去，一阶而已，班列大同。安有天子三公，可辄拜人者！损魏朝之望，亏晋王之德；君子爱人以礼，吾不为也！’及入，顗遂拜，而祥独长揖。王谓祥曰：‘今日然后知君见顾之重！’”","attribution":"《汉晋春秋》","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_001.xhtml","index":246,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-493794a4280db39895d4","start":0,"end":190,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-q-b-ded6d700dc6f860d1670","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-ded6d700dc6f860d1670","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗四年：景元四年（公元 263）。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_001.xhtml","index":201,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-ef642248e44d01f3825d","start":0,"end":19,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-q-o165","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-b35fdf03685051716720","layer":"original","quote":"四年春二月〖1〗，复命大将军进位、爵赐，一如前诏。又固辞，乃止。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_001.xhtml","index":194,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":32,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-q-o171","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-cef469d41ec5962b4e48","layer":"original","quote":"咸熙元年春正月，壬戌〖1〗，槛车征邓艾〖2〗。甲子〖3〗，行幸长安。壬申〖4〗，使使者以璧币祀华山〖5〗。是月，钟会反于蜀，为众所讨。邓艾亦见杀。二月，辛卯〖6〗，特赦诸在益土者。庚申〖7〗，葬明元郭后。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_001.xhtml","index":220,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":102,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
